  </task>
</exercise>
<exercise workspace = "2in">
  <statement>
    <p>
      Let <m>X</m> be a continuous RV with pdf
            <m>f(x)=xe^{-x^2/2}, \,\, 0\lt x\lt \infty</m>. Find <m>P(X>2)</m>. 
